  "ruleText": "Fam 104.03 Public Access to Records. Requests for information and access to records shall be made in accordance with Plc 104.01.\n\nSource. #5609, eff 4-6-93, EXPIRED: 4-6-99\n\nNew. #7716, INTERIM, eff 6-22-02, EXPIRED: 12-19-02\n\nNew. #7916, eff 7-11-03; ss by #9667, eff 4-2-10; ss by #14430 (formerly Fam 105.03), eff 11-22-25",
